Package: drawdb
Version: 1.9.0
Architecture: amd64
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ericbyz <ericbyz@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: Database entity relationship diagram editor (DrawDB)
 DrawDB is a free, simple and extensible online database diagram editor:
 design ER diagrams visually, export SQL for MySQL/PostgreSQL/SQLite/
 MariaDB/MSSQL and more, and generate diagrams from DBML. This package
 serves the upstream SPA as pure static files from the TOS web server
 (no background service, no extra port) inside the desktop floating
 window at http://<NAS>/drawdb/.
 Built from upstream drawdb-io/drawdb v1.9.0 (AGPL-3.0) at a pinned
 commit, dist SHA256-locked; monaco editor and icon fonts are bundled
 locally (intranet-safe, no CDN).
